From: Scott Smith <scott@newtrostudios.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:27:37 -0400
Subject: remotesmith(0103): hardened default settings
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Seed DEFAULT_SETTINGS with approve-mode=password, direct-server=Y and
enable-lan-discovery=Y (user-changeable), and OVERWRITE_SETTINGS with
verification-method=use-permanent-password, so the temporary password stays
disabled and cannot be turned back on, and allow-hide-cm=N, so the renamed
(custom-client) build can never hide the host's connection window (§6.2a).
custom.txt (if any) still extends both maps.

Plan: DEC-10, DEF-13, AC-10, AC-60, §4 thin-fork patch 3.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
